UniSim includes an adaptation of the hfield triangulation strategy from
MuJoCo-LiDAR (https://github.com/discoverse-dev/MuJoCo-LiDAR), Copyright (c)
2025 Yufei Jia, MIT License. The adapted code is in
``src/unisim/backend/ray_scene.py`` and materializes MuJoCo's hfield top
surface, skirt walls, and base box as the closed ray-collision solid.
